#: src/postulo/plugins/esco/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "ESCO occupations and skills"
msgstr "Impjiegi u ħiliet tal-ESCO"

#: src/postulo/plugins/esco/__init__.py
#, fuzzy
msgid "Suggests job titles from ESCO, the European classification of occupations, in your language, and recognises the skills you record against ESCO's list of skills. It reads files an administrator downloads once with manage.py fetch_esco and asks no service while you work. Switched off, the title and skill boxes are plain and every code and skill already kept stays as it is."
msgstr "Jissuġġerixxi titli tax-xogħol mill-ESCO, il-klassifikazzjoni Ewropea tal-okkupazzjonijiet, bil-lingwa tiegħek, u jagħraf il-ħiliet li tirreġistra skont il-lista tal-ħiliet tal-ESCO. Jaqra fajls li amministratur iniżżel darba bi manage.py fetch_esco u ma jitlob l-ebda servizz waqt li taħdem. Meta jkun skonnettjat, il-kaxxi tat-titlu u tal-ħiliet ikunu sempliċi u kull kodiċi u ħila li diġà nżammu jibqgħu kif inhuma."
